      "data": {
        "text": "**Choosing a Provider**\n\nI've decided to move forward with the Google Cloud Speech-to-Text API. It seems like a solid, well-documented option for the transcription task, and I'll be implementing it using the provided client library.\n\n\n**Defining the Transcription Script**\n\nI'm now focused on writing the `submit_transcription.py` script. The plan is to have a dedicated function for submitting the audio file to the Google Cloud Speech-to-Text API, using the Python client library. Provider identification will come from import statements and the client instantiation itself. The script will be written directly in the current working directory.\n\n\n",
        "time": {
          "end": 1789820981997,
          "start": 1789820979945
        },
        "type": "reasoning"
      },
      "id": "prt_0b9a4cae9001C778b7rrYG2mT5",
